ngx_http_zstd_static_module of nginx-zstd-module (sysadmin-labs 0.1.3) not from the
config of the module: there it is configured with the filter, before ngx_brotli (the
filter of zstd has to be), so its handler stood before that of brotli_static and nginx,
which calls the handler registered last first, gave a client of "zstd, br" the .br. It
is a module of its own, --add-module=<module>/static after ngx_brotli (the Makefile;
files/extra-patch-zstd-static: its config, and the module). aZ, 22.11.2026 17:57:
«ngx_http_zstd_static_module не нужен», 19:52: back, «если это технически грамотно».
Applied by post-patch in WRKSRC_zstd, -p0.

